{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“Lorentz 协变性”"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"Lorentz协变性"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Lorentz 协变性是在 "},{"Local":{"url":"Lorentz群","text":"Lorentz 群"}},{"Plain":"作用下的协变性.</p>\n<p>Lorentz 协变性是 “管定律的定律”.</p>\n<p>Maxwell 电磁理论天生就有 Lorentz 协变性.</p>\n<p>Newton 运动定律不具有 Lorentz 协变性.</p>\n<p>Newton 万有引力理论与 Coulomb 电磁学具有相似的形式, 它们都不是 Lorentz 协变的.</p>\n"}]}}